  "invariants": [
    "Every applicable dimension is explicit in each typed module slice; admin actions never become runtime permissions. Empty sets grant no authority; no absent/wildcard/legacy scope upgrade.",
    "Scope validUntilNs exceeds validFromNs. Finite intervals only; an unsupported unbounded proposal denies rather than widening.",
    "PLATFORM_ROOT requires issuer PLATFORM and absent parent. CHILD requires a different parent envelope. ROTATION requires the same envelope identity and next semantic revision; it is not new-child delegation.",
    "CHILD usable and grantable must both narrow actual current parent grantable in every dimension, with at least one strict narrowing and a reduced onward depth. ROTATION must narrow or equal each prior corresponding scope. These comparisons never prove current authority.",
    "Parent/issuer/platform/role/assignment/session epochs and grantability are derived and fenced by durable owners; signature verification is historical cryptographic evidence only.",
    "Proposal digest is SHA-256 of exact submitted Proposal bytes. Submission freezes semantic revision/bytes/digest. The final artifact embeds the same bytes; it does not change the submitted object.",
    "Submission approval advances submittedVersion by one. Activation binds a distinct fresh candidate, operation and approval at expectedApprovedVersion and next activeVersion; old consumed intent is never rewritten.",
    "Submission and activation each bind distinct maker/checker principals with actual independent authority and one-use step-up evidence. Issuer authority equals frozen submission maker authority.",
    "Public envelopeDigest for ACTIVE is SHA-256 of exact canonical Envelope bytes, excluding COSE signature. Proposal digest remains separately immutable. Activation candidate binds proposal and expected APPROVED version, never resulting envelope digest; no digest cycle.",
    "Signed artifact, digest, immutable history, state, mutation evidence and outbox publish atomically under existing owners. Unknown provider/commit outcomes reconcile the original attempt before retry.",
    "Signer purpose/key/profile/environment/workload and parent authority need separate current admission; no automatic widening of keys, legacy digest-text authority or public recipient field."
  ]
